# Normalize line endings to LF for everyone, regardless of OS/editor.
# Without this, npm on Windows periodically rewrites package-lock.json
# (and other generated files) with different line endings than what's
# committed, which git then reports as a local change and blocks `git
# pull` with a merge conflict.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
